---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import InquiryForm from '../components/InquiryForm.astro'
import ArticleCard from '../components/ArticleCard.astro'
import {buildPages,sections,types} from '../lib/pages'
import {renderRichText} from '../../../../packages/content/richtext.mjs'
import {article,serializeJsonLd} from '@site/seo'
export async function getStaticPaths(){return(await buildPages()).map(page=>({params:{path:page.path.slice(1,-1)||undefined},props:page}))}
const page=Astro.props,{kind,doc,articles,topics,services,cases}=page
const listing=sections[kind]?articles.filter(x=>x.section===kind):kind==='topic'?articles.filter(x=>x.topics?.some(t=>(typeof t==='object'?t.id:t)===doc.id)):articles
const featured=articles.filter(x=>x.featured),latest=(featured.length?featured:articles).slice(0,3)
const plain=(node:any):string=>node?.text||node?.children?.map(plain).join('')||''
const headings=kind==='article'?(doc.content?.root?.children||[]).filter(n=>n.type==='heading').map(n=>plain(n)):[]
let html=kind==='article'?renderRichText(doc.content):'',headingIndex=0
html=html.replace(/<h([1-6])>/g,(_,n)=>'<h'+n+' id="section-'+headingIndex+++'">')
const schema=kind==='article'?article({title:doc.title,description:doc.description,url:new URL(page.path,Astro.site).href,publishedAt:doc.publishedAt,updatedAt:doc.updatedAt,author:doc.authorName||'海老板编辑部',locale:'zh'}):null
const summary=sections[kind]?.intro||(kind==='topic'?page.description:kind==='services'?'从明确的业务问题出发，确定可检查的交付，再逐步建立增长能力。':kind==='cases'?'方案让你理解方法，证据帮助你判断结果。两者分别说明。':kind==='contact'?'告诉我们你的产品、目标市场和当前卡点，从值得先验证的环节开始。':kind==='about'?'把经验变成系统，把线索变成增长。':kind==='search'?'搜索已发布的行业观察、AI 解读与实战指南。':kind==='privacy'?'说明本站咨询信息的用途，以及你可以如何联系我们。':'行业信息、AI 应用与实战方法，按你的问题开始阅读。')
---
<Layout {...page}>{schema&&<script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={serializeJsonLd(schema)}/>}
{kind==='home'?<>
<section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><i></i> 为出海企业而写，为真实增长而做</span><h1>看懂出海机会，<br/>把 <span>AI</span> 用进业务。</h1><p class="lead">行业正在发生什么，AI 能帮你做什么，下一步怎么走。海老板把信息、方法和服务放在一起，陪你把增长变得具体。</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/articles/">阅读最新内容 ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/services/">了解增长服务 →</a></div><div class="hero-foot"><span>行业观察</span><b>＋</b><span>AI 应用</span><b>＋</b><span>增长服务</span></div></div><div class="signal-board"><div class="board-top"><span>HAIBOSS / GROWTH SIGNALS</span><span class="live-dot">持续观察</span></div><div class="board-heading">让信息，<br/>沿着业务流动。</div><div class="signal-path">{[['01','看见变化','行业 · 市场 · 工具'],['02','作出判断','产品 · 买家 · 机会'],['03','形成行动','内容 · 触达 · 跟进']].map(x=><div><span>{x[0]}</span><section><strong>{x[1]}</strong><small>{x[2]}</small></section><b>↗</b></div>)}</div><div class="board-bottom"><span>从一个具体问题开始</span><a href="/contact/">开始对话 ↗</a></div></div></section>
<div class="principles"><div class="wrap"><span>有来源的信息</span><span>有条件的判断</span><span>能执行的方法</span><span>可检查的交付</span></div></div>
<section class="wrap section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / EDITOR'S PICKS</span><h2>值得花时间看的内容。</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/articles/">全部内容 ↗</a></div>{latest.length?<div class="article-grid">{latest.map((item,i)=><ArticleCard item={item} index={i}/>)}</div>:<p class="empty">正在整理有来源、与出海业务相关的内容。欢迎通过 RSS 关注后续更新。</p>}</section>
<section class="section section-tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">02 / FIND YOUR NEXT STEP</span><h2>从你关心的问题读起。</h2></div><p>把动态放回业务里，把方法用到工作中。</p></div><div class="channel-grid">{Object.entries(sections).map(([key,v],i)=><a class="channel" href={'/'+key+'/'}><span class="channel-number">0{i+1}</span><span class="eyebrow">{v.eyebrow}</span><h3>{v.title} ↗</h3><p>{v.intro}</p><small>{articles.filter(x=>x.section===key).length} 篇内容</small></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">03 / KNOWLEDGE THAT CONNECTS</span><h2>把零散阅读，连成一条路径。</h2></div></div><div class="topic-grid">{topics.map((item,i)=><a class="topic-card" href={'/topics/'+item.slug+'/'}><span>TOPIC / 0{i+1}</span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.description}</p><b>进入专题 ↗</b></a>)}</div><div class="subscribe"><div><h3>为下一次判断，留一个信息入口。</h3><p>通过 RSS 阅读海老板的新内容，按自己的节奏关注。</p></div><a class="button outline" href="/rss.xml">订阅更新 ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="wrap section service-preview"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">04 / WORK WITH HAIBOSS</span><h2>需要一起把事情做完？</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/services/">查看服务与交付 ↗</a></div><div class="service-grid">{services.map((item,i)=><a class="service-card" href="/services/"><span>0{i+1} / SERVICE</span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.description}</p><b>了解合作方式 ↗</b></a>)}</div></section>
</>:kind==='article'?<>
<header class="article-header wrap"><a class="eyebrow" href={'/'+(doc.section||'guides')+'/'}>{sections[doc.section]?.title||'实战指南'} / {types[doc.contentType]||'编辑观察'}</a><h1>{doc.title}</h1><p class="lead">{doc.description}</p><div class="article-byline"><span>{doc.authorName||'海老板编辑部'}</span><time datetime={doc.publishedAt}>发布 {new Date(doc.publishedAt||doc.createdAt).toLocaleDateString('zh-CN',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai'})}</time><span>{Math.max(2,Math.ceil(plain(doc.content?.root).length/400))} 分钟阅读</span></div></header>
<div class="wrap article-layout"><aside class="article-toc"><details open><summary>本页目录</summary><ol>{headings.map((title,i)=><li><a href={'#section-'+i}>{title}</a></li>)}</ol></details><a class="toc-contact" href="/contact/">把问题带进你的业务 ↗</a></aside><article class="prose"><div class="article-summary"><b>先看要点</b><p>{doc.description}</p></div><div set:html={html}/>{doc.sources?.length>0&&<section class="sources"><h2>来源与核查</h2><p>本文含海老板的编辑解读和行动建议。来源所述能力不等于本项目已完成实测。</p><ol>{doc.sources.map(s=><li><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{s.title} ↗</a>{s.checkedAt&&<small>核查：{new Date(s.checkedAt).toLocaleDateString('zh-CN',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai'})}</small>}</li>)}</ol></section>}<div class="article-end"><span>HAIBOSS / 从信息到行动</span><p>如果这也是你正在面对的问题，可以把产品、目标市场与当前卡点告诉我们。</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">聊聊你的具体问题 ↗</a></div></article></div><section class="wrap section"><div class="section-head"><h2>继续阅读</h2><a href="/articles/">全部内容 ↗</a></div><div class="article-grid">{articles.filter(x=>x.id!==doc.id).slice(0,3).map((item,i)=><ArticleCard item={item} index={i}/>)}</div></section>
</>:<>
<header class="page-heading wrap"><span class="eyebrow">{sections[kind]?.eyebrow||'HAIBOSS / INSIGHT & ACTION'}</span><h1>{page.title}</h1><p class="lead">{summary}</p></header>
{(sections[kind]||['articles','topic'].includes(kind))&&<section class="wrap listing"><div class="filter-nav"><a href="/articles/" aria-current={kind==='articles'?'page':undefined}>全部内容</a>{Object.entries(sections).map(([key,v])=><a href={'/'+key+'/'} aria-current={kind===key?'page':undefined}>{v.title}</a>)}<span>{listing.length} 篇</span></div>{listing.length?<div class="article-grid">{listing.map((item,i)=><ArticleCard item={item} index={i}/>)}</div>:<p class="empty">本栏目正在整理，先读读其他专题。</p>}</section>}
{kind==='services'&&<section class="wrap listing"><div class="service-grid detailed">{services.map((item,i)=><article class="service-card" id={{'buyer-development':'pain-points','content-growth':'ai-growth','ai-workflows':'growth-loop'}[item.slug]}><span>0{i+1} / SERVICE</span><h2>{item.title}</h2><p>{item.description}</p><h3>可交付什么</h3><p>{item.deliverables}</p><h3>如何开始</h3><p>{item.scope}</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">讨论这项服务 ↗</a></article>)}</div><div class="process-strip">{['明确产品与目标','确定试点范围','交付并共同验证','复盘与继续优化'].map((x,i)=><div><b>0{i+1}</b><strong>{x}</strong></div>)}</div><p class="notice">具体范围、周期与费用在了解资料后确定。采购决策和订单结果受产品、市场及实际执行影响。</p></section>}
{kind==='cases'&&<section class="wrap listing"><div class="case-grid">{cases.map(item=><article class="case-card"><span class="pill">{item.kind==='verified-case'?'实际案例':'方案示范'}</span><h2>{item.title}</h2><p>{item.description}</p><div class="notice">{item.evidence}</div><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">讨论适合你的方案 ↗</a></article>)}</div>{!cases.length&&<p class="empty">正在整理可公开的方案与实践记录，欢迎直接了解服务范围。</p>}</section>}
{kind==='about'&&<section class="wrap narrow prose listing"><h2>技术服务于业务</h2><p>海老板关注传统外贸团队真正费时间的地方：找客户、找对人、做判断、准备沟通，以及把经验留在团队里。</p><h2>信息与服务，相互连接</h2><p>我们整理出海行业信息，关注 AI 能力变化，并把方法拆成可以理解和验证的步骤。对需要一起落地的问题，提供明确范围的增长服务。</p><h2>从小处开始验证</h2><p>从一个产品、一个市场或一条工作流程切入。信息标注来源，方案说明适用条件，实测结果保留过程依据。</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">和海老板聊聊 ↗</a></section>}
{kind==='contact'&&<section class="wrap contact-layout listing"><div class="contact-info"><span class="eyebrow">TALK TO HAIBOSS</span><h2>从一个具体问题开始。</h2><p>产品与供应链能力、目标市场、客户类型，或是你当前最难推进的环节。</p><a class="phone" href="tel:18805065692">188 0506 5692 ↗</a><p>也可以填写咨询表。提交后请保存接收编号，便于后续核对。</p><a href="/privacy/">查看隐私说明 →</a></div><div class="form-panel"><h2>留下你的问题</h2><InquiryForm locale="zh"/></div></section>}
{kind==='privacy'&&<section class="wrap narrow prose listing"><h2>我们收集什么</h2><p>当你主动提交咨询时，本站接收你填写的姓名、邮箱、企业及问题描述，以及表单来源、提交时间和用于防止重复提交的标识。</p><h2>用于什么</h2><p>这些信息用于接收、核对和跟进你的咨询，处理重复提交及排查故障。请勿提交密码、验证码、客户机密或其他无关的敏感信息。</p><h2>内容与外部链接</h2><p>文章来源链接指向各自网站，访问后适用对方的隐私说明。RSS 和本站内容搜索仅包含公开文章。</p><h2>联系与更正</h2><p>如需更正或请求删除咨询信息，请通过电话 188 0506 5692 联系海老板，并提供咨询接收编号以便核对。</p></section>}
{kind==='search'&&<section class="wrap listing search-area"><label for="content-search">输入产品、市场或工作问题</label><input id="content-search" type="search" placeholder="例如：客户开发、AI 搜索、内容更新" autocomplete="off"/><p id="search-status" role="status">输入关键词，搜索本站公开内容。</p><div id="search-results" class="search-results"></div><script define:vars={{entries:articles.map(x=>({title:x.title,description:x.description,url:'/articles/'+x.slug+'/'}))}}>const input=document.getElementById('content-search'),results=document.getElementById('search-results'),status=document.getElementById('search-status');function search(){const query=input.value.trim().toLowerCase(),matches=query?entries.filter(x=>(x.title+' '+x.description).toLowerCase().includes(query)):[];results.replaceChildren();for(const item of matches){const a=document.createElement('a'),h=document.createElement('h2'),p=document.createElement('p');a.href=item.url;h.textContent=item.title;p.textContent=item.description;a.append(h,p);results.append(a)}status.textContent=query?'找到 '+matches.length+' 篇相关内容':'输入关键词，搜索本站公开内容。'}input.addEventListener('input',search);input.value=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('q')||'';search();</script></section>}
</>}
</Layout>
